os/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528059523","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100191#issuecomment-2528059523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100191","id":2528059523,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WryCD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T14:06:23Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T14:06:23Z","body":"So testing this the case happens when `gui_embed_subwindows` is *false*, none of the code in the MRP uses this\n\nSo probably a duplicate of:\n* #62382 \n\nSo please see that for more details, closing this as a duplicate, but if you think this is not a duplicate please comment here and this can be reopened\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528059523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528208416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100191#issuecomment-2528208416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100191","id":2528208416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WsWYg","user":{"login":"shitake2333","id":8806796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDY3OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8806796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333","html_url":"https://github.com/shitake2333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T14:49:56Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T14:51:34Z","body":"> So testing this the case happens when `gui_embed_subwindows` is _false_, none of the code in the MRP uses this因此，当 `gui_embed_subwindows` 为 _false_ 时，就会发生这种情况，MRP 中的任何代码都不会使用此\n> \n> So probably a duplicate of:所以可能是以下的重复：\n> \n> * [`always_on_top` breaks non-embedded popups #62382](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/62382)\n> \n> So please see that for more details, closing this as a duplicate, but if you think this is not a duplicate please comment here and this can be reopened因此，请参阅有关更多详细信息，请将其作为重复项关闭，但如果您认为这不是重复项，请在此处发表评论，并且可以重新打开\n\nThe value of `gui_embed_subwindows  ` is not critical.\n\nThis is essentially whether the window is native.\n\nWhen the window is native, the window sorting is actually done by the operating system, and godot just calls the operating system's API.  https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/62382 is that the system API is not called correctly.\n\nWhen the window is non-native, the window sorting is done by godot itself, which is implemented in the [viewport](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4/scene/main/viewport.cpp#L251-L273).\n\nIssue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/62382 discusses the problem of native windows, and this issue discusses the problem of non-native windows. Therefore, the fix [pr](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100179)  cannot fix the problem of this issue.\n\nAlthough they have the same external performance, I prefer to use different issues. This allows the fixer to only care about one code problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528208416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528288056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100191#issuecomment-2528288056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100191","id":2528288056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wsp04","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T15:12:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T15:12:01Z","body":"Then you need to update the issue because you wrote \"embed_subwindows\"\n\nReopening but the description needs to be updated to make the issue clear","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528288056/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817901577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100191#issuecomment-2817901577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100191","id":2817901577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n9cQJ","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T08:09:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T08:09:45Z","body":"@AThousandShips Confirmed, provided that the issue is basically that setting always_on_top truly lives up to its name and doesn't propagate to elements that are logically children. \n\nTo use the MRP to repro the issue, compare the result of clicking on MENU when Top is true vs false. The popup that comes from the dropdown that's part of the always_on_top subwindow is sorted behind it, making the dropdown unusable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817901577/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]